2. In these Regulations, unless the context otherwise requires —
“identity card”, for an individual, means an identity card issued to the individual under the National Registration Act (Cap. 201);
“serving employee” means an individual, who on 1 April 2016, is an employee;
“work pass”, for an individual, means a work pass issued to the individual under the Employment of Foreign Manpower Act (Cap. 91A).
